      "family": "formulaic_flattery",
      "phase": "aftermath",
      "derivation": "context_rewrite",
      "source_index": 2852,
      "source_excerpt": "玩机器公式化讨好：哈哈哈（尬笑）",
      "classic_anchor": "公式化讨好",
      "id": "epic_streak_0001"
    },
    {
      "text": "不再隐藏实力？五个起步全靠狗运🤡",
