      "family": "hidden_strength",
      "phase": "burst",
      "derivation": "context_rewrite",
      "source_index": 63,
      "source_excerpt": "白字不再隐藏实力——15级",
      "classic_anchor": "不再隐藏实力",
      "id": "epic_streak_0002"
    },
    {
      "text": "气球厂气泵拆了让你吹，连收几个装神仙🤡",
