      "family": "audio_equipment_joke",
      "phase": "burst",
      "derivation": "context_rewrite",
      "source_index": 1008,
      "source_excerpt": "去气球厂里可以把气泵拆了你来瞎吹",
      "classic_anchor": "气泵拆了",
      "id": "epic_streak_0003"
    },
    {
      "text": "慌乱的操作，这一串每一帧都是笑柄💀",
