      "family": "frame_by_frame_mockery",
      "phase": "burst",
      "derivation": "context_rewrite",
      "source_index": 216,
      "source_excerpt": "慌乱的抉择 每一帧都是笑柄 看你的直播真是种享受",
      "classic_anchor": "每一帧都是笑柄",
      "id": "epic_streak_0004"
    },
    {
      "text": "弹幕夸你操作硬我还以为是在串，太搞笑了🤣",
      "intent": "audience_pile_on",
      "family": "danmaku_rebellion",
      "phase": "burst",
      "derivation": "context_rewrite",
      "source_index": 2026,
      "source_excerpt": "我还以为是在串，结果还能是真的啊",
      "classic_anchor": "我还以为是在串",
      "id": "epic_streak_0005"
    },
    {
      "text": "确实有点实力，但全靠对面慈悲🙏",
      "intent": "cynical_sarcastic",
      "family": "captured_seven_times",
      "phase": "burst",
      "derivation": "context_rewrite",
      "source_index": 2144,
      "source_excerpt": "我承认你确实有点实力",
      "classic_anchor": "确实有点实力",
      "id": "epic_streak_0006"
    },
    {
      "text": "获得称号慧眼识猪，一眼看出这一串全靠蒙🤡",
