      "family": "pig_farm_meta",
      "phase": "burst",
      "derivation": "context_rewrite",
      "source_index": 5272,
      "source_excerpt": "获得了\"慧眼识猪\"称号，你也来一起参与吧",
      "classic_anchor": "慧眼识猪",
      "id": "epic_streak_0007"
    },
    {
      "text": "高呼我游龙了，结果在淤泥里欢快乱拱🐷",
      "intent": "flame_streamer",
      "family": "piggy_dragon",
      "phase": "aftermath",
      "derivation": "context_rewrite",
      "source_index": 5305,
      "source_excerpt": "\"我游龙了！他们都不敢碰我！\"抹了一身",
      "classic_anchor": "我游龙了",
      "id": "epic_streak_0008"
    },
    {
      "text": "好蠢看不下去了😩，但这一串怎么这么逗",
      "intent": "cynical_sarcastic",
      "family": "spectator_fatigue",
      "phase": "aftermath",
      "derivation": "context_rewrite",
      "source_index": 3807,
      "source_excerpt": "好蠢看不下去了😩…但是能蠢到什么地步呢",
      "classic_anchor": "好蠢看不下去了",
      "id": "epic_streak_0009"
    },
    {
      "text": "叫小姐太虚伪，叫枪神太浮夸，晚上好，运气批💅",
      "intent": "flame_streamer",
      "family": "streamer_flame",
      "phase": "aftermath",
      "derivation": "context_rewrite",
      "source_index": 18403,
      "source_excerpt": "叫小姐太虚伪 叫客服太现实",
      "classic_anchor": "叫小姐太虚伪",
      "id": "epic_streak_0010"
    },
    {
      "text": "这是人类啊？手抖成缝纫机还连收😱",
