      "family": "inhuman_bot",
      "phase": "burst",
      "derivation": "context_rewrite",
      "source_index": 119,
      "source_excerpt": "这是人类啊",
      "classic_anchor": "这是人类啊",
      "id": "epic_streak_0011"
    },
    {
      "text": "心理委员来了🚬抽利群吧，这波狗运救不了你",
      "intent": "cynical_sarcastic",
      "family": "health_warning",
      "phase": "aftermath",
      "derivation": "context_rewrite",
      "source_index": 7479,
      "source_excerpt": "彳亍，心理委员来了。不哭不哭，抽利群🚬🚬🚬",
      "classic_anchor": "心理委员来了",
      "id": "epic_streak_0012"
    },
    {
      "text": "一辈子就硬这一串，透支完下辈子全马枪💀",
