      "family": "miracle_overdraft",
      "phase": "aftermath",
      "derivation": "context_rewrite",
      "source_index": 755,
      "source_excerpt": "卧槽这fy真tm废啊🤮一辈子就硬一个ti8",
      "classic_anchor": "一辈子就硬",
      "id": "epic_streak_0013"
    },
    {
      "text": "真正的清醒者已经看穿：这波全是对面送的🤔",
