      "family": "clear_headed",
      "phase": "burst",
      "derivation": "context_rewrite",
      "source_index": 4890,
      "source_excerpt": "孙子在笑，真正的清醒者沉重地发了\"爆了\"",
      "classic_anchor": "真正的清醒者",
      "id": "epic_streak_0014"
    },
    {
      "text": "装糖扮小丑🎪五个起步真当自己是战神了？",
