      "family": "ego_inflation",
      "phase": "aftermath",
      "derivation": "context_rewrite",
      "source_index": 991,
      "source_excerpt": "猪哥，你现在是一哥了，以后膨胀我能理解",
      "classic_anchor": "以后膨胀",
      "id": "epic_streak_0016"
    },
    {
      "text": "黑白无常都看傻了：你阳寿已尽还敢狂杀💀",
